# =============================================================================
# .gitignore — AWS CardDemo modernized target
# Java 21 / Spring Boot (multi-module Maven) + React 19 / Node.js 24 (Vite)
#
# Baseline: GitHub community Java + Maven + Node templates, merged and
# de-duplicated for this repository. Directory patterns are intentionally
# unanchored so they match at any depth: the repository root, the frontend/
# workspace, and every Maven module's build output.
#
# Legacy mainframe sources (app/), reference assets (diagrams/, samples/),
# and all committed configuration/templates remain tracked — see the final
# "Do NOT ignore" section.
# =============================================================================

# ---- Java / Maven ----
# Per-module build output (matches target/ in every Maven module)
target/
# Compiled bytecode and packaged binaries
*.class
*.jar
# Keep the committed Maven Wrapper jar even though *.jar is ignored above
!.mvn/wrapper/maven-wrapper.jar
*.war
*.ear
*.nar
# Maven Wrapper scratch
.mvn/timing.properties
# maven-release-plugin / build-helper scratch files
pom.xml.tag
pom.xml.releaseBackup
pom.xml.versionsBackup
pom.xml.next
release.properties
dependency-reduced-pom.xml
buildNumber.properties
# JVM fatal-error / replay logs
hs_err_pid*
replay_pid*

# ---- Node / React ----
# Dependency directories (root and frontend/ and any nested workspace)
node_modules/
jspm_packages/
# Build output (Vite dist/, CRA build/, SSR output, Vite cache)
dist/
dist-ssr/
build/
.vite/
# Package tarballs from `npm pack`
*.tgz
# npm / yarn / pnpm caches and lint cache
.npm/
.eslintcache
# Test coverage output (root and frontend/)
coverage/
.nyc_output/
*.lcov
# Node debug logs (rotated variants such as npm-debug.log.1 are covered here)
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
lerna-debug.log*
.pnpm-debug.log*

# ---- IDE ----
# IntelliJ IDEA
.idea/
*.iml
*.iws
*.ipr
# Eclipse
.settings/
.project
.classpath
.factorypath
.apt_generated/
bin/
# Visual Studio Code — ignore per-user settings but keep the shared
# recommended-extensions list so the whole team gets the same tooling hints
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json

# ---- Secrets & Env ----
# Never commit real credentials or local environment overrides
.env
.env.*
# Allow a committed, non-secret template
!.env.example
# Local-only overrides (e.g., Vite *.local, application-local.*)
*.local

# ---- Logs & Runtime ----
*.log
logs/
*.tmp

# ---- OS ----
# macOS
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
# Windows
Thumbs.db
Thumbs.db:encryptable
ehthumbs.db
desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/

# ---- Do NOT ignore (intentionally tracked config, templates & sources) ----
# The patterns above deliberately do NOT match the following committed files;
# they are listed here as a maintenance reminder so future edits keep them
# trackable:
#   - k8s/*.yaml (including k8s/secret.yaml — a placeholder TEMPLATE, not a real secret)
#   - observability/prometheus.yml, observability/grafana-dashboard.json
#   - docker-compose.yml
#   - pom.xml (root aggregator and per-module) — only pom.xml.* scratch is ignored
#   - frontend/package.json and frontend/package-lock.json
#   - db/migration/*.sql (Flyway schema and seed scripts)
#   - application.yml and logback-spring.xml (per-service config)
#   - .env.example and .mvn/wrapper/maven-wrapper.jar (re-included via negations above)
#   - legacy sources: app/, diagrams/, samples/ (includes samples/**/*.zip runtime bundles)
